OL,3,GNEWSAMan praises surgeons for
OL,4,Areattaching severed thumb
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Bear in mind just over 24 hours
OL,7,Fearlier my thumb was on the floor in a
OL,8,Fpool of blood," Parry said.
